  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Limiting friction force is, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo> </mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.1</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.5</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>For first case:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f993deed-c4ed-4422-a0ff-17e4c9608121.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 238px;\"/></p><p>We can write, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo> </mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.5</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>For second case:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/962abe96-2141-4eed-a9d9-41da095ad14a.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 227px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo> </mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.5</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
